In accordance with one embodiment of this invention, a method is disclosed whereby an advertisement-delivery server, which is linked to a user terminal, can display advertisements via an advertisement-delivery application that has been installed on that terminal. This method involves the following stages:

(a) obtaining, from the user terminal, an activation-request signal that seeks to switch the terminal's display component from an off condition to an on condition;

(b) presenting the advertisement on the display component in response to that activation-request signal;

(c) obtaining, from the user terminal now showing the advertisement, an advertisement-content-request signal that seeks the delivery of advertising content linked to the displayed advertisement;

(d) upon receipt of this advertisement-content-request signal, delivering the advertising content to the user terminal; and

(e) crediting the user terminal with a first reward corresponding to the activation-request signal, together with a second reward corresponding to the advertisement-content-request signal.
